WEBVTT

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.640
You send the invite from HomecareOS.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:14.400
They get an email, set a password, and complete each section themselves.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.420
The application form, documents, references, DBS information, availability and declarations.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.790
As they go, you’re alerted.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.080
The application is finished — a bell on your screen.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.820
A document is uploaded — you’re told.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.360
A reference comes back — it’s already on their file.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.720
When every open step is done, they’re ready for review.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.080
No more searching Outlook.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.020
No more chasing WhatsApp.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.740
No more juggling inboxes.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.820
The pipeline shows where everyone has got to, from application through to onboarding.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:54.200
You book the interview — the date, the time, and how you’ll meet — and they’re emailed the details.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:58.260
After it, the outcome and your notes sit on the same file.

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:02.880
Then you make the offer: the role, the rate, the contract.

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.060
They’re told, they answer, and it’s recorded.

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:14.670
Later sections can open — health declaration, bank details, starter checklist — all in the same portal.

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:22.170
From the first invite to the day they’re hired, everyone is kept in the know, and everything is stored in one place.

